From: PiSight port <hello@trex-ai.ca>
Date: Wed, 27 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add bcm2835 V4L2 M2M hardware MJPEG encoder backend

Adds a V4L2 mem2mem MJPEG encoder (bcm2835-codec, /dev/video11) used in
preference to libjpeg, with automatic fallback to the software encoder
when no hardware encoder is present.
